WEBVTT

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.830
It was supposed to be a simple quest.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.640
Just pick a few medicinal herbs
 from the mountain...

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.790
"Oh, there's no snow this time of year,

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:30.590
so it'll be an easy quest."

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:34.070
That's what Mao-chan-sensei told us.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.390
It's snowing really hard, 
and we can't get home!

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:50.970
At this rate, we're all going to die!

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.830
Endro!

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:25.500
Roll 10

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.290
It's cold.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.190
It's bright.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.780
It is bright.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.360
But it's not warm.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.920
Yeah.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.400
Should we burn something?

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.930
B-Burn what?

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:04.790
Clothes?

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:06.790
Mei-chan, calm down.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.350
Right.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.020
As cold as it is,

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.410
we might die if we fall asleep,

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.790
so we need to be careful.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:20.180
If we fall asleep...

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.080
We'll die?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.560
S-Seira-chan, don't sleep!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.640
I nodded off for a moment.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.700
Thanks, Yusha.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:37.820
Mei-chan!

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.510
Mei! Mei!

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.760
If you sleep, you'll die!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:42.040
Achoo!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:45.020
Th-That was close.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.550
Thank you, Seira-san.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.260
Yuu-chan!

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.250
Don't sleep!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.530
I'm awake! I'm awake!

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.840
Seira-chan, don't sleep!

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.100
Ow, ow, ow!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:04.670
Mei, wake up!

00:04:04.670 --> 00:04:06.600
Here, drink this plain, bitter tea.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.600
It's really bitter!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.360
Yusha-san, open your eyes!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.300
At this rate, everyone's going to fall asleep.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.230
I know! Hey, everyone!

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.240
Why don't we talk about something?

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:23.110
I think that'll keep us from feeling sleepy.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.030
Oh, that's a good idea!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.490
But what should we talk about?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.990
Well...

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.370
How about our dreams for the future?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:33.060
Oh, sounds fun!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.270
That's great.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.120
Who should we start with?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.380
Mei-chan first, then!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.100
Me? Sure.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:40.950
Ahem.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.720
I have two dreams.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.860
One is going to Tarka Village,

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.830
but I already achieved that one.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.380
Tarka Village was fun, wasn't it?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.510
There were lots of yummy foods, too!

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:07.120
And the fireworks were pretty.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:12.100
That was the happiest day of my life so far!

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.210
And my second dream is...

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:16.460
What?

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:22.380
Why, completing a full collection
 of all Cartado, of course!

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:27.400
There are Cartado with forbidden spells
sealed away in ancient ruins!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:33.080
There are Cartado that bring 
good luck to their owners.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.640
Only one in every billion monsters
drops them wen defeated!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:41.650
And there are the mysterious 
Cartado nobody has ever seen,

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.070
the heirlooms of the Royal Family!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.580
There are so many different kinds 
of unusual Cartado in this world!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:54.150
And I want to obtain them all!

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:55.730
That sounds just like you, Mei.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.050
Cartado <i>is</i> the first thing 
you make me think of.

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.730
I'd love to see unusual Cartado, too.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:06.840
Then, once I've collected all the Cartado,

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.300
I'll unleash their true power,

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.930
and they'll gain a will of their own!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.310
Huh?

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:15.660
As a result,

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:19.640
the Cartado, with their superior 
power, will rule over all

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.820
and start a brand new world!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.430
Mei-chan, get a grip!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.420
It's all for the Cartado.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.270
Mei-chan, what are you saying?!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.120
I don't care how! Just wake up!

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:41.690
I'm next, then!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:46.840
I want to go on adventures around the 
world and eat lots of delicious food!

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:53.040
In the southern seas, there's a fish said 
to have seven flavors in and of itself!

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:58.730
There's the world's sweetest apple, 
the golden apples of the northern jungle!

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:03.720
Then there's the boar of the eastern plains that 
even 1,000 people together can't finish eating!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.990
And I want to eat them all!

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:09.460
Wow, I've never heard about those.

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:12.570
You have impressive knowledge 
when it comes to food.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.940
They all sound really yummy!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.370
Th-That wasn't me.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.870
Then who was it?

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:23.290
I'm hungry.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:25.460
I want something to eat.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.380
Oh, no! Fai-chan is...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.840
Just feed her something! Anything!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.180
Are you all right?

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:44.450
I'm used to this.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.900
What's your dream for the future, Seira-chan?

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.100
Me?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.350
I...

00:07:58.820 --> 00:07:59.540
<i>Wait...</i>

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.010
<i>I can't very well say that!</i>

00:08:02.010 --> 00:08:03.040
What's wrong?

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:05.230
Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:08.540
<i>Which leaves...</i>

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:13.800
<i>Realistically, I want to do something 
about my room by graduation.</i>

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.680
Start of School

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.680
It was clean at first.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.810
Present

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.560
I wonder when it ended up like that.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.080
<i>How did it turn out like this?</i>

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.570
<i>I don't know at all.</i>

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.870
Seira-san's entered a state of deep thought.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:34.820
I wonder what her dream is.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:39.020
Oh, well. Let's hear about 
Yusha-san's dream first.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.330
Hey!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.480
Don't fall asleep! Wake up!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.860
I'm awake! I'm awake!

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:48.760
That's what someone who isn't awake says!

00:08:48.760 --> 00:08:52.060
Come on! Tell us about your dream, Yusha-san!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.740
My dream?

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:58.300
Well, I'm dreaming right now.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.970
Not that dream!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.230
Your dream for the future!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:04.580
The future?

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.170
I want to be the Hero, of course.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:13.070
I'll stand up against the 
Demon Lord when they revive,

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.490
then I'll fight them in awesome ways.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:22.680
But once I'm moments away from defeating 
them, my spell will go out of control.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:28.340
And then I'll get blasted off somewhere
 alongside everyone else.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.290
That got a little crazy halfway through.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.200
I guess she's still half asleep.

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:36.270
But it feels oddly realistic.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:43.600
W-We're being crushed!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.830
We need something to support it!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.620
I know!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.060
I brought that long pole this time!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:00.760
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.700
It's the Demon Lord!

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:21.010
The Demon Lord's finally revived!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.200
This world is finished!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.100
Could that be...

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.230
Yes! It is!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:47.430
She's the one who stood against a million 
soldiers of the Demon Lord all by herself

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:48.730
and drove them back!

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:51.510
She's heralded as the strongest 
in the history of Heroes—

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.390
the Hero among Heroes!

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:56.010
Yulia Chardiet-sama!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.260
Pose!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:01.390
Yes! I heard she defeated the 
Magic Emperor that was sealed

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.830
in ancient ruins, after a magic duel 
spanning seven days and nights!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:09.390
She's heralded as the strongest in both magic
 and the sword—the Hero among Heroes!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:12.090
That's definitely Yulia Chardiet-sama!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:14.650
Ka-shink!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.400
She looks just like my dead wife 
did when she was younger.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.060
I'm the one who was just introduced!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.220
Yulia Chardiet!

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.790
Call me Yusha!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.470
Pose! Pose! Pose!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:31.790
Yusha! Yusha! Our hope!

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:35.050
Yusha! Yusha! Defeat the Demon Lord!

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.050
Yusha-sama!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.800
Everyone, thank you for your support!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.800
Yusha-sama!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:43.240
Now, I'm off to defeat the 
Demon Lord! Here I go!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:01.910
Caught it!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:10.410
Yes! I finally got one of the rainbow 
coelacanth that has seven flavors!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:11.920
Now, then...

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:14.670
Time to eat!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.100
That's the best!

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.680
Ah!

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:33.650
Oh, thanks...

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.200
<i>Ba-dump...</i>

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.000
I'm so happy!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.840
Here we go, Demon Lord!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.280
Darling...

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:57.150
I love how my room's sparkling again today!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:02.800
Lately my shoulders have been aching 
from how heavy my breasts are, though...

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:05.310
Wait...

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:07.340
That'll never happen!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.390
That was...

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:15.430
I figured.

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.010
What about the others?

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.840
A monster?!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.420
What's that?!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.680
Yusha! Fai! Mei!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.620
Prepare yourself, Demon Lord!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:35.870
So yummy!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.560
So happy...

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.310
Everyone, wake up!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.030
Wake up!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.820
Monster Encyclopedia

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.820
Her monster encyclopedia!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.450
Carta eater...

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.910
It sneaks up on adventurers at night,

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.830
makes them dream,
 and lulls them into a deep sleep.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:02.270
Then normal methods won't wake them up, huh?

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.680
Do we have something? Anything?

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.590
This!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.780
A Dream Dive Cartado that lets 
you enter the dream world!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:15.110
Lead me into the dream world, Dive!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.760
Wait for me, everyone!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.620
So this is everyone's dream...

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.360
Yusha! Fai! Mei!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.430
Prepare yourself, Demon Lord!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:35.620
Yusha! Yusha! Defeat the Demon Lord!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:39.000
She looks just like my dead wife 
did when she was younger.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.880
Grazie, grazie!

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.840
I want a new Cartado!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.620
I ended up frozen!

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.730
Everyone!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:03.770
Open your eyes! You're in a dream!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.520
At this rate, something terrible will happen!

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:09.450
Even if this is a dream,

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.040
as the Hero, I can't just ignore the Demon Lord!

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.580
Yes, that sounds cool and Heroic,

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.530
but no one's asking for that right now!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.990
Don't talk with your mouth full!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.250
This is really tasty!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.000
You don't need to make a 
point of telling me that!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:28.390
True, this may be a dream.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.560
I knew it, Mei!

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.070
You understand what's going on right now!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.370
But I want you to wait a moment.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.140
Huh?

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:39.770
Even if this is the dream world,
 what's the problem?

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:40.890
Huh?

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:42.760
Look at those two.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.650
Yusha's fighting the Demon Lord.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.500
Prepare yourself, Demon Lord!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.400
Go, go, Yusha!

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.150
Go, go, Yusha!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:55.410
She looks just like my dead wife 
did when she was younger.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.910
Now, then...

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.660
Time to eat!

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:01.160
Fai-san's overjoyed to eat her fill.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.910
Buono!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.510
Those two are truly happy right now.

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:10.720
Can you really interfere 
with their happiness?

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.860
I-I...

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.050
You should join us here as well, Seira-san.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.780
You'll be even happier, too.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:24.940
What's that Cartado?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.770
A Cartado that makes breasts bigger!

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:33.100
Even if they're bigger

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.890
in my dreams,

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:39.180
I'll just feel empty!

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:43.080
My darling!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.590
If all of you refuse to wake up,

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:49.790
then I'll just destroy this world!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.080
Our worlds!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.940
Sei-chan, stop!

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.420
I don't want to face reality!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.480
Just wake up already!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.640
Let's deal with this by 
combining all our dreams!

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:17.380
Right!

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:20.950
We can stand against Sei-chan with 
the power of three people's dreams!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.180
Roger that!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.340
Yes!

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.010
Yeah!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.240
Yeah!

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:29.820
My dream of defeating the Demon Lord!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:32.090
My dream of eating delicious food!

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.510
And my dream of Cartado!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.260
This is...

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:45.250
This is the crystallization of our dreams!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.130
Yummy...

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.010
...Demon Lord...

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:48.840
...Cartado!

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.500
Seriously? "Yummy"?

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.750
Oh, you're right. It is yummy!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.000
Really?!

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.590
I want to eat some, too!

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.340
Let me try.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:21.860
It's so good!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.100
I can't stop eating this!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.020
That was delicious!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:43.060
I'm full!

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:45.180
We ended up eating it all.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:46.870
We really did.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:50.020
Wait! That was the 
crystallization of our dreams!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.310
And Sei-chan ate it!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.880
That's terrifying, eating people's dreams.

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:58.960
Don't talk as if I'm the only one who ate it!

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:02.070
Wait!

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.390
You won't get away!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:24.910
Huh?

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:26.470
Where are we?

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:28.910
It seems we're awake now.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:33.020
Seira-chan, that was mean!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.260
I wanted to eat more yummy things!

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.300
I'll never get to have 
such a nice dream again.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.670
Shut up!

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.680
Now, look! This was all this thing's fault!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.020
A monster?

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.360
When did that...

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:47.520
Is this a carta eater?

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:48.120
Yes.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.180
Carta eater?

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:54.440
It makes adventurers fall asleep 
and then eats all their Cartado.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.560
It's a terrifying monster.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:57.880
Wait.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:20:59.880
What?!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:03.200
It got us good!

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:06.910
Sounds like that monster is 
Mei-chan's worst enemy.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.560
So then, if Sei-chan hadn't woken us up...

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:12.740
It would've eaten all of them.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:15.210
I see. Thank you, Seira-chan!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.940
It's nothing to thank me for.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:21.030
It's only natural to save 
your fellow party members.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.400
Seira-chan, you're so cool.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:33.360
You're the only one who wasn't 
taken in by her own dream.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.620
The carta eater makes people dream about

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.980
the things they wish for from 
the bottom of their hearts.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:44.020
You can't overcome it unless 
you have formidable willpower.

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:46.410
You really are incredible, Seira-san!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:48.430
Of course I am.

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:51.740
Now, it's stopped snowing,
 so let's take those medicinal herbs home!

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:52.540
Yeah!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.160
Time to clear the quest!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.250
Right!

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:03.400
<i>I should at least clean my room better.</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Final Dead End!

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:38.660
"Final Dead End!"
